		<title>Oscar Isaac on Madonna and the W.E. Premiere at the Venice Film Festival</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/134-oscar-isaac-on-madonna-and-the-we-premiere-at-the-venice-film-festival.html"/>
		<published>2011-10-04T11:48:11Z</published>
		<updated>2011-10-04T11:48:11Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/134-oscar-isaac-on-madonna-and-the-we-premiere-at-the-venice-film-festival.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interviewed by &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.theatermania.com/off-broadway/news/10-2011/oscar-isaac-here-and-now_41787.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Theater Mania&quot;&gt;Theater  Mania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; actor &lt;strong&gt;Oscar Isaac&lt;/strong&gt; talks about &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; and the premiere of &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt; for the Film Festival.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;It  was great. I had never been to &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt;,&quot; says &lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt;. &quot;The  Italians and &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; are really a cool mix, and it was great to  see the film for the first time with such a warm audience.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt; also talks about having &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; as a director. &quot;She was intense, she was really determined, and she has an amazing  wealth of knowledge about art and aesthetics, so it was easy to trust  her,&quot; he says. &quot;What's really great about her is that she expects the best of  everyone and won't settle for mediocrity. I had to learn to play piano  for this role, and she made sure I went to rehearsal every day.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;I found  it refreshing to work with someone who's into every minute detail,&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt; adds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interviewed by &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.theatermania.com/off-broadway/news/10-2011/oscar-isaac-here-and-now_41787.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Theater Mania&quot;&gt;Theater  Mania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; actor &lt;strong&gt;Oscar Isaac&lt;/strong&gt; talks about &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; and the premiere of &lt;strong&gt;W.E.&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt; for the Film Festival.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;It  was great. I had never been to &lt;strong&gt;Venice&lt;/strong&gt;,&quot; says &lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt;. &quot;The  Italians and &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; are really a cool mix, and it was great to  see the film for the first time with such a warm audience.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt; also talks about having &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; as a director. &quot;She was intense, she was really determined, and she has an amazing  wealth of knowledge about art and aesthetics, so it was easy to trust  her,&quot; he says. &quot;What's really great about her is that she expects the best of  everyone and won't settle for mediocrity. I had to learn to play piano  for this role, and she made sure I went to rehearsal every day.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&quot;I found  it refreshing to work with someone who's into every minute detail,&quot; &lt;strong&gt;Oscar&lt;/strong&gt; adds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
